  },
  "slides": {
    "slide_0": {
      "group": "Verse 1",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Is this a day of new beginnings,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Time to remember and move on,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Time too believe what love is bringing,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Laying to rest the pain that's gone?",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_1": {
      "group": "Verse 2",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "How can the seasons of a planet",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Mindlessly spinning round its sun",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "With just a human name and number",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Say that some new thing has begun?",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_2": {
      "group": "Verse 3",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Yet through the life and death of Jesus",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Love's mighty Spirit, now as then,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Can make for us a world of difference",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "As faith and hope are born again.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_3": {
      "group": "Verse 4",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Then let us, with the Spirit's daring,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Step from the past and leave behind",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Its disappointment, guilt, and grieving,",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Seeking new paths, and sure to find.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    },
    "slide_4": {
      "group": "Verse 5",
      "color": "#2563eb",
      "settings": {
        "color": "",
        "resolution": {
          "width": 1920,
          "height": 1080
        }
      },
      "children": [],
      "notes": "",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "lines": [
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Christ is alive, and goes before us",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "To show and share what love can do.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "This is a day of new beginnings;",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "align": "text-align:center;",
              "text": [
                {
                  "value": "Our God is making all things new.",
                  "style": "font-size:52px;font-family:sans-serif;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "style": "top:100px;left:100px;height:880px;width:1720px;",
          "align": "align-items:center;"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
